{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/伏刃","pageid":8494,"revid":21088,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8F%E5%88%83&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8F%E5%88%83&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8F%E5%88%83&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>伏刃</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E4.BC.8F.E5.88.83\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"伏刃\"><b>伏刃</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 伏刃.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ee/pkbrrttr890lryymq2ynjpv8br8lo2e.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%BC%8F%E5%88%83.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ee/pkbrrttr890lryymq2ynjpv8br8lo2e.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%BC%8F%E5%88%83.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ee/pkbrrttr890lryymq2ynjpv8br8lo2e.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />伏刃\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>正前方半圆4格\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）本次行动内未主动攻击，则可使用或触发。选择方向，准备1回合，并获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"敛锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">敛锋</font></span></span>]（持续到下次行动开始）、<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">锋芒</font></span></span>]；技能释放后，对正前方半圆<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">凛冬极星</font></span>]效果。<br />✦准备期间不触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"格挡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">格挡</font></span></span>]，受到伤害降低（效果等同于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性减伤•SP阿加塔\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">个性减伤•SP阿加塔</font></span></span>]效果），被攻击后提前触发准备效果；若触发后拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>层及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">锋芒</font></span></span>]，则再次进入准备状态。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：释放技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">敛锋之姿</font></span>]时，自动触发本技能主动效果。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 正前方半圆4格.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/df/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/df/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/df/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"743\" data-file-height=\"743\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E5%8A%A0%E5%A1%94%E2%80%A2%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E6%9E%81%E6%98%9F\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿加塔•凛冬极星\"><img alt=\"头像 阿加塔•凛冬极星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/6uwrip42fpim5p1wbon2zaut4c4ot5q.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">阿加塔•凛冬极星</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"敛锋之姿\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%95%9B%E9%94%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%A7%BF\" title=\"技能图鉴库/敛锋之姿\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/105px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"127\" /></a></div>\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"敛锋之姿\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80